        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "85001b85-5f0d-5a89-b264-02ae30f4579d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Oklahoma City Thunder, Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, University of Notre Dame, University of Florida, NBA\n- People: Billy Donovan, Lewis Preston, Kevin Durant\n- Events: 2015–16 Oklahoma City Thunder season\n- Products: NBA 2K15, NBA 2K13\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2015–16 season, the Oklahoma City Thunder won the Northwest Division and clinched the third seed in the Western Conference after just missing the playoffs the previous season.\n- Billy Donovan, born on May 30, 1965, is an American professional basketball coach who was the head coach of the Oklahoma City Thunder in the NBA.\n- Lewis Preston previously served as an assistant men's basketball coach at Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, the University of Notre Dame, and under Billy Donovan at the University of Florida.\n- Kevin Durant of the Oklahoma City Thunder was one of the three cover athletes of NBA 2K13 and the solo cover athlete of NBA 2K15.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
